  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ずいぶん嬉しそうだな\r\n何かいいことでもあったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000310020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "実はですね、近くにあるチョコレートカフェに\r\nユニットのみんなと行くことになったんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100031/1010001000310020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（なるほど、それは楽しみだろうな）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "チョコの研究会が\r\nできるな",
    "nextLabel": "1010001000311"
  },
  {
    "select": "チョコの専門店か？",
    "nextLabel": "1010001000312"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "お土産頼むな",
    "nextLabel": "1010001000313"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000310030,
    "label": "1010001000311",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そうなんです！　しかもみんなと一緒に！\r\nこれは全メニュー制覇しなきゃだなって思ってて！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100031/1010001000310030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000310040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "楽しみすぎておやつも止まらないんです……！\r\n……ってあれ！？　なんで笑ってるんですか！？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100031/1010001000310040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000310050,
    "label": "1010001000312",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "もちろんです！　今、チョコってすごく人気なんですよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100031/1010001000310050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000310060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "チョコを使ったパスタとか、\r\nドレッシングもあるくらいですから！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100031/1010001000310060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000310070,
    "label": "1010001000313",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あっ……ごめんなさい……\r\nお土産買いたいのはやまやまなんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100031/1010001000310070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000310080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そのお店、テイクアウトがないんです……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
